{"4006240": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Banner Tactics", "steam_appid": 4006240, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Turn-Based Tactics</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Different enemies appear depending on the region, and weather effects have a significant impact on your tactics. You must deploy the right soldiers for the situation and use various skills to achieve your mission objectives.<strong></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><br>Tabletop World System</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When you return after battle, one world turn passes. Prepare for the future by building structures and conducting research. You can recruit more expensive and powerful soldiers and help them grow.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Faction Reputation</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Contact various local factions and build your reputation with them. You can get not only monetary support but also unique companions with their own stories and voice actors.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All dialogue has been professionally voice-acted.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Turn-Based Tactics</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Different enemies appear depending on the region, and weather effects have a significant impact on your tactics. You must deploy the right soldiers for the situation and use various skills to achieve your mission objectives.<strong></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><br>Tabletop World System</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When you return after battle, one world turn passes. Prepare for the future by building structures and conducting research. You can recruit more expensive and powerful soldiers and help them grow.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><st